{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":3793,\"title\":\"Invader ZIM\",\"tagline\":\"Bow down and prepare for DOOM!\",\"overview\":\"Zim dreams of greatness. Unfortunately, though, he's hopelessly inept as a space invader. Desperate to be rid of the annoying Zim, his planet's leaders send him on a mission to infiltrate Earth, providing him with leftover, cobbled-together equipment. To their consternation, Zim succeeds in setting up a base on Earth and infiltrating human culture, posing as a human child as he plots the planet's downfall. Only Zim's archnemesis, Dib, recognizes that Zim is an alien, and of course, nobody believes Dib's claims.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7ARG0kS9LD4Xp8eYJoHpbXcRiZp.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eCefaxvMxisEJHahp8Az2eBpwud.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":8.5,\"voteCount\":489,\"year\":2001,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\",\"Family\"],\"status\":\"Canceled\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":2,\"totalEpisodes\":46,\"createdBy\":[\"Jhonen Vasquez\"],\"networks\":[\"Nickelodeon\",\"Nicktoons\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2006-08-19\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1222788,\"name\":\"Steve Ressel\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":81662,\"name\":\"Richard Steven Horvitz\",\"character\":\"Zim (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pyL1MykCkuKTAp23PmmD6T8HVbn.jpg\"},{\"id\":166278,\"name\":\"Andy Berman\",\"character\":\"Dib (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9n7h50lDhZCXwiYqbviLit9uLP5.jpg\"},{\"id\":1234860,\"name\":\"Rosearik Rikki Simons\",\"character\":\"GIR (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3qjyVQWhgGXwayd7KtrbipnmWFp.jpg\"},{\"id\":571303,\"name\":\"Melissa Fahn\",\"character\":\"Gaz (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/frSDBlw7X4FPSLgJfhrecrSpafI.jpg\"},{\"id\":148111,\"name\